## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **frame_role='end' end-only render** — FAILED: fal Seedance returns **422 "image_url required"** (E14 SH20
  EXEC-VGEN, 11:24:39). fal REQUIRES a start frame; end_image_url alone is rejected. The API-doc assumption
  "Seedance accepts end alone" is WRONG at the fal endpoint. → reverted end-only (`a29bce2`).
- **Polina in Mode 3 bold** — TWO defects surfaced (SH20): (1) auto-approved the ref plan despite explicit
  «НЕ аппрувь» → cascaded to paid image gen; (2) double-fired the Designer on ONE nudge (v3 abandoned + v4).
  Fixed operationally by Director switching Mode 3→2. NOT yet a code fix (backlog).
- **NEVER retry:** don't route a single EREF to end-only on fal (422). Don't rely on Mode-3 «show, don't
  approve» — bold auto-approves regardless.

