## Decisions Made

- **frame_role='end' end-only is dead** — fal requires a start frame. Real fix = Designer designs the
  **START/opening frame** (a ref showing the ENDING makes the video animate backwards). frame_role kept only
  as a label for the future two-frame/handoff PR.
- **V15 orbit = advisory** not hard REVISE (empirical guidance kept; unblocks experiments).
- **Mode 2 (HYBRID)** is the right operating mode when the Director wants review control — Polina keeps
  operational tools but cannot auto-approve creative gates.
- **Car-wash = next episode**, start clean. Cross-shot handoff PR waits for its success.
- Autonomy stack stays inert until Director runs the paid smoke.

